Agents Anywhere DSH Bridge

This package preserves the origin and authorship of the DSH bridge originally
developed by xipian1216:

  Source: https://github.com/xipian1216/dsh-aa-bridge
  Author: xipian1216

The implementation entered Agents Anywhere in commit:

  16395489be15b3a9e87ba9a5394629b2ab57a942
  feat(dsh): import Desktop bridge plugin

Subsequent integration and ownership documentation appeared in:

  cac7e76bef9bf9f126fdc4be8d6260470df6c58d
  53a136cbef7297c0ea90395184ad35bdf61d69b9

The current package is a source rewrite against the shared DSH Bridge 1.0
contract and the verified DeepSeek Harness Host API. It does not include the
imported generated lib output, source maps, or private protocol fixtures.
